WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.101
-"Saturday Night Live,"

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:04.336
you're hosting for
the first time this weekend.

00:00:04.336 --> 00:00:05.738
-Yeah.
-How's it going, buddy?

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:09.041
-I'm intermittently terrified
and confident.

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:11.077
So, one minute -- one minute,
I'm, like, shaking.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.678
-That's the balance you want.

00:00:12.678 --> 00:00:15.147
-Yeah, shaking with terror
in my dressing room going,

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:16.950
"Why did I ever agree
to do this?

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.818
I'm the most unfunny person
in the world."

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:20.086
-No.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.421
-And the next minute,
I'm, like, ling of comedy.

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:22.989
I'm like,
"I know what I'm doing."

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:24.524
So it's like a roller coaster.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.893
I have ultimate admiration
for those guys who do it.

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:28.895
-Oh, I saw the bits
that you've been doing,

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.463
the promos with Leslie Jones.

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:32.932
And, man, oh, man,
it's hilarious.

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.134
-Yeah, it was
a good induction into it,

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:37.504
just being abused
by Leslie Jones.

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:39.472
-Yeah. What was
the concept behind that?

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:41.507
It's just her fantasy
of what she thinks?

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:43.976
-Yeah, the concept was that
she's just been so excited

00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:46.879
about the "Thrones SNL,"

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:49.114
and she's mocking up
all these different things.

00:00:49.114 --> 00:00:50.583
And then she gets me.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.485
And then I'm like,
"There's no one else here.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:55.188
We've not even started 'SNL.'

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:56.355
What is going on?"

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:58.157
-"What is happening?"
It's really great.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:00:59.658
-Sara Bareilles, musical guest.

00:00:59.658 --> 00:01:01.694
I'm telling you,
you're gonna be great.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.496
And it's such a rush
and such a good cast.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.865
I mean, everything I've heard --
I've heard great things.

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:07.467
They love working with you
up there.

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:10.236
Is -- Have you gotten
advice from anyone?

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:16.643
-Uh, I -- Who did I turn to
to get advice from?

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:19.913
Like, I rang my mum.
-Yeah.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:21.414
There you go. Yeah, why not?

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:24.117
-Like, not, like, Peter Dinklage
or Jason Momoa

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.484
or, you know, James McAvoy.

00:01:25.484 --> 00:01:26.852
I rang my mum.

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:29.189
And I said --
And she's like, "What is it?"

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.824
And I'm like,
"It's like stand-up comedy."

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:34.226
She's like,
"Well, you don't do that."

00:01:34.226 --> 00:01:36.395
I was like,
"Yeah, well, that -- I know.

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:37.764
I know I don't do that."

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:40.533
She's like, "But you're
really good at the sad stuff."

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.302
And I was like, "Thanks, Mum."

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.470
-"Yeah, I'm so happy
I called you for advice."

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:45.871
You got to call me next time,

00:01:45.871 --> 00:01:47.373
yeah, 'cause
I'll pump you up, man.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:48.674
-Yeah.
-I got to ask you.

00:01:48.674 --> 00:01:51.978
One of the most famous lines
involving you in the show

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.880
is "You know nothing, Jon Snow."

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.349
Is that the line that people
yell to you all the time

00:01:57.349 --> 00:01:58.918
on the street or...?

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:02.421
-Yah, and my wife is Rose,
so we get doubly yelled at.

00:02:02.421 --> 00:02:03.956
You know?
-Oh, yeah. That's like --

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:05.291
Exactly. Yeah.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.326
Do people try to sneak it
into conversation with you?

00:02:07.326 --> 00:02:09.195
"By the way,
you know nothing, Jon Snow."

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:11.631
-Yeah, I mean,
the worst is my --

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:14.734
Like, 'cause I hate it.
I hate it when people say it.

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:17.570
And my brother managed to get it

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.540
into the end
of my best man's speech.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.108
-[ Laughs ]
That's what brothers are for!

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.909
-It was quite sweet, actually.

00:02:23.909 --> 00:02:27.947
He said, "But looking
at the woman you're marrying,

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:30.350
it shows you do know something,
Jon Snow."

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.984
-Aww.
-It's just sweet.

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:33.219
-That actually --

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:35.388
Hey, good on you.
Good on you, brother.

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:37.456
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:37.456 --> 00:02:41.627
I've heard a couple of rumors,
and I wondered

00:02:41.627 --> 00:02:44.163
if you could maybe dispel
these rumors tonight.

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:45.998
Just -- Nothing that major.

00:02:45.998 --> 00:02:48.034
I mean, again -- But we'll see.

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:49.735
I was just -- I just heard --

00:02:49.735 --> 00:02:53.706
There's a rumor that once --
Not that bad --

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:57.443
That once you went to a costume
party dressed as Jon Snow?

00:02:57.443 --> 00:02:59.478
-Yeah. Yeah, I did.
-Is that true?

00:02:59.478 --> 00:03:02.281
-Yeah.
Unfortunately, that is true.

00:03:02.281 --> 00:03:04.550
How did you hear that?

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.152
I -- Yeah.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:10.722
Well, the theme was --
It was rose's 30th birthday.

00:03:10.722 --> 00:03:12.591
And she decided the theme

00:03:12.591 --> 00:03:15.661
for the costume party
was "bad taste."

00:03:15.661 --> 00:03:18.064
So I thought about it.

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:21.100
And I thought, you know,
what's worse taste

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:25.304
than going as the character
you play in the show you're on?"

00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:27.306
-It's actually genius.
-It's really bad taste.

00:03:27.306 --> 00:03:29.108
So I did, thinking
this was really funny.

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:33.112
The trouble was that we had
these two girls, you know,

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:36.448
handing out canapés
and drinks and things.

00:03:36.448 --> 00:03:38.017
And they ha not been told

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:39.953
what the theme of
the costume party was.

00:03:39.953 --> 00:03:41.621
So they just saw me dressed

00:03:41.621 --> 00:03:44.223
as my character from
"Game of Thrones."

00:03:44.223 --> 00:03:46.625
-They were probably like --
-It's like, "You sad, sad man."

00:03:46.625 --> 00:03:49.429
-[ Laughs ] Was it your
real costume from the show?

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:51.197
-And I was trying to explain it.

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:52.665
I was like,
"No, the theme is 'bad taste.'"

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:54.167
-Oh, wow. Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:56.669
-Was it your actual costume
from the show?

00:03:56.669 --> 00:03:59.238
-No, I just bought it
from a costume store.

00:03:59.238 --> 00:04:01.640
And they were like --
-Yeah, what were they like?

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:03.476
-They were looking at me like --
-Did they know who you were?

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:05.945
-"Is this where you get
your costumes from?"

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:07.980
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:11.217
-I love that. I also heard
a rumor that there's a statue.

00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:13.086
You have statues.

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:14.853
-Where are you getting
all these rumors?

00:04:14.853 --> 00:04:17.523
-I've started them
on the Internet.

00:04:17.523 --> 00:04:19.225
You guys all have statues there.

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:21.393
And I heard that
you kept your statue.

00:04:21.393 --> 00:04:23.395
-Yeah, I did.

00:04:23.395 --> 00:04:26.265
That is, again --
I can affirm your rumor.

00:04:26.265 --> 00:04:27.700
Yeah.
-You have a statue of yourself?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.703
-Well, we did this thing.
This is what you have there.

00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:31.870
Yeah, it's the --

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.173
We had, like, a scene

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:36.375
where we all come up
against our statues.

00:04:36.375 --> 00:04:38.644
And they --
And I said, "Can I keep it?"

00:04:38.644 --> 00:04:42.782
And they looked at me
and said, "Yeah. I guess.

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:44.383
If you want."

00:04:44.383 --> 00:04:45.651
-Did anyone else
ask for their statue?

00:04:45.651 --> 00:04:48.187
-So I made them ship it
to my house in England.

00:04:48.187 --> 00:04:50.356
It's a full-size statue.
It must have cost --

00:04:50.356 --> 00:04:54.193
No, no. Sophie and Maisie
didn't keep their statues.

00:04:54.193 --> 00:04:56.429
So I think this is -- I really
have to take a long look

00:04:56.429 --> 00:04:58.765
in the mirror and kind of ask --

00:04:58.765 --> 00:05:00.500
Or at my statue.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.869
-Do you talk to your statue
sometimes when you're lonely?

00:05:03.869 --> 00:05:05.838
-I think now, you know --

00:05:05.838 --> 00:05:08.240
Everyone keeps asking me
how is "Thrones" ending.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.610
And I'm obviously sad
about it ending.

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:14.380
And I thought I'd make the
statue into a kind of shrine

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:17.917
in my garden that I go
and cry in front of and --

00:05:17.917 --> 00:05:20.253
-And lay flowers. Yeah.
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:05:20.253 --> 00:05:21.787
-That's fantastic.

00:05:21.787 --> 00:05:25.625
The last rumor that I
heard/started on the Internet --

00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:28.127
Um, I heard that you can't wink.

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:31.497
-Yeah, I can't wink.
-Is that true, though? For real?

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:33.566
-You know,
I thought I could wink.

00:05:33.566 --> 00:05:35.635
And then -- and then every time
I've winked

00:05:35.635 --> 00:05:37.936
on a chat show or anything,

00:05:37.936 --> 00:05:41.173
my friends and everyone have
picked up that I can't wink.

00:05:41.173 --> 00:05:43.509
So, no, I don't --
-Do you mind trying it today?

00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:44.877
-Well, this is -- Yeah.

00:05:44.877 --> 00:05:46.745
-Look into camera three there
and just give a good --

00:05:46.745 --> 00:05:48.948
Ready? Give a wink.
Like, "Hey, how ya doing?"

00:05:48.948 --> 00:05:50.249
[ Drum roll ]

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:52.952
-That's a wink, right?
-Is that -- Try it again.

00:05:52.952 --> 00:05:54.153
[ Laughter ]

00:05:54.153 --> 00:05:56.456
Yeah. It's almost --
It's a wink blink.

00:05:56.456 --> 00:05:59.292
It's very interesting. It is
a wink. But it's also a blink.

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:03.162
Which brings me to my last thing
that I wanted to try with you.

00:06:03.162 --> 00:06:06.898
There's all these rumors
and spoilers from the trailer

00:06:06.898 --> 00:06:11.237
that we saw that's already out
for the final season.

00:06:11.237 --> 00:06:13.805
And I was thinking
if I can show a picture

00:06:13.805 --> 00:06:16.008
and ask you something about it.

00:06:16.008 --> 00:06:21.681
Maybe give me a wink for "yes"
and a blink for "no."

00:06:21.681 --> 00:06:22.948
[ Laughter ]

00:06:22.948 --> 00:06:24.350
All right. Here we go.
-Okay.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.051
-Ooh, I remember seeing this.

00:06:26.051 --> 00:06:27.820
-Looking down camera?
-Yeah.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.589
You can go down to camera three.
I saw this. Look at this.

00:06:30.589 --> 00:06:32.658
This is the sword
hidden in the snow

00:06:32.658 --> 00:06:34.593
as the snow drift
gets blown away.

00:06:34.593 --> 00:06:37.764
Does this mean
that you are dead?

00:06:39.398 --> 00:06:41.634
[ Applause ]

00:06:46.171 --> 00:06:49.509
Then I saw this.
Look at this. Flames everywhere.

00:06:49.509 --> 00:06:53.446
Destruction.
Does this mean everyone dies?

00:06:55.915 --> 00:06:57.416
[ Laughter ]

00:06:57.416 --> 00:06:59.852
[ Applause ]

00:06:59.852 --> 00:07:01.087
Last one. Last one.

00:07:01.087 --> 00:07:03.189
And then I'll let you
off the hook.

00:07:03.189 --> 00:07:06.459
This picture right here.
Uh-oh. Wow.

00:07:06.459 --> 00:07:09.395
Does Jon Snow
get to ride a dragon?!

00:07:11.563 --> 00:07:12.965
[ Laughter ]
Oh, my God!

00:07:12.965 --> 00:07:17.036
Wow! The spoilers!
Kit Harington, everybody!

